 r←Test_Busy_008(stopFlag batchFlag);n;i;⎕TRAP;noOfThreads;parms;F
⍝ Exercise `Busy` with a parent
 r←∆Failed
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')

 noOfThreads←⍴⎕TNUMS

 parms←#._APLGUI.GUI.Busy.CreateParms
 parms.parent←⍎'F'⎕WC'Form'
 n←parms #._APLGUI.GUI.Busy.Create'This may take a moment...'

 n.∆CloseForm
 ⎕NQ'F' 'Close'

 r←∆OK
